 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? Of course. Are you looking for eateries that serve it in menu, or do you want shortlist of what's available to order in? Lots of apps and websites tell you. In the UK, the free app for this is My food around me. Pasta, sauces, bread, some fruit, and some vegetables. It' the basics really. Then you look up place and check if they have a gluten free version, usually made with rice flour. It is. Lots of people skip all gluten menus. It's easy to miss that so many places now do gluten free.",
